==Notes==
* The Golden Dawn Institute was formerly the site of a moonwell built and consecrated by [[Moon Priestess Alunasha]], an envoy of High Priestess [[Tyrande Whisperwind]], as a gift to the high elven people. The moonwell has been removed when the region was expanded into the [[Thalassian Highlands]]. It was also the location of the teleport to Stormwind City, done through [[Tanilaeh Sunkiss]], which was also removed with the expansion of the Highlands.

